    tldr: "Bu Zhong Yi Qi Tang is an eight-herb Chinese formula for fatigue and weakness, commonly prescribed to people with lung cancer in Taiwan. Small studies suggest less fatigue, better quality of life and less weight loss in cancer, but large well-designed trials have not been done. Nausea and bloating have been reported.",
